msgstr "Receiving storage is full. Free space or add a server of the required type."

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_4A7D1297E15D"
msgid "接通频道前听一会儿背景噪声"
msgstr "Listens to background noise before connecting"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_98C2FE486054"
msgid "搜索商品"
msgstr "Search goods"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_805A3E11A917"
msgid "播种季：种子涨价"
msgstr "Planting season: seed prices up"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_566C483CD373"
msgid "攒够维修货船的费用"
msgstr "save enough to repair the cargo ship"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_02D0627CF9AF"
msgid "收藏沿途的旧货票"
msgstr "Collects old cargo tickets along the route"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_36B3764D702D"
msgid "收购"
msgstr "Purchasing"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_981258BAAACE"
msgid "收集不同星球的小石头"
msgstr "Collects stones from different worlds"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_824B38CF588C"
msgid "敷衍地打断"
msgstr "Dismissive interruptions"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_E5FE8C7E90EE"
msgid "无法交易：供货商已离开、余额/额度不足，或没有可交易库存。"
msgstr "Unable to trade: supplier departed, insufficient balance or budget, or no tradeable stock."

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_9906FCC51E85"
msgid "旧殖民地集散港"
msgstr "Old colony cargo hub"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_4D9105324C05"
msgid "显示本供应商到访以来的报价；鼠标移入图表可查看各周期价格。"
msgstr "Quotes recorded since this supplier arrived; hover over the chart to inspect each cycle."

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_E0291499361D"
msgid "普通独立行商。个人经历不是市场预测依据。"
msgstr "An ordinary independent trader. Personal experiences are not evidence of future market prices."

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_DB8CE41D0560"
msgid "暂无交付计划\n"
msgstr "No delivery plan yet\n"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_E83D08B85782"
msgid "暂无符合条件的现货或可售材料。可清空搜索或选择其他供应商。"
msgstr "No matching stock or saleable materials. Clear the search or select another supplier."

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_E530F30AA2F3"
msgid "曾做仓库维修与船舱整理，擅长辨认还能派上用场的工业材料。货箱来自不同批次，包装常有修补痕迹。"
msgstr "Once repaired warehouses and organized holds; knows which industrial materials still have value. Crates come from mixed batches, often with patched packaging."

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_A5A84D846268"
